      "message": "My plan was to separate the driver overhaul into 2 CLs to minimize CL complexity. One which focuses on reformatting the devicetree, and one focusing on the driver logic. An unfortunate side effect of that decision is that there are some artifact left behind due to legacy LED logic such as all color transitions have to have unique numbers until the next commit is pushed.\n\nIf you think it would be better to have everything as a big CL, I can keep working on the patch so that there is no interim artifacts between commits.",
